# OUR PROJECTS PAGE – ULTRA PREMIUM CINEMATIC PORTFOLIO
## WoW Studio | Luxury Wedding Photography & Cinematic Films

Transform the existing Our Projects page into an extraordinary, visually immersive portfolio experience inspired by world-class luxury wedding photography and film production websites.

The objective is to showcase every project like a cinematic story rather than an ordinary image gallery.

## 1. CINEMATIC PROJECT HERO
- Create a full-screen cinematic hero section.
- Use high-quality wedding photography or video from existing project assets.
- Apply slow camera zoom and subtle parallax.
- Animate "OUR PROJECTS" using split-text typography.
- Reveal the subtitle with blur-to-sharp transitions.
- Add a minimal animated scroll indicator.
- Use premium cinematic color grading.

## 2. PROJECT CATEGORY FILTER
Create elegant animated category filters:
- All Projects
- Wedding Photography
- Wedding Films
- Pre-Wedding
- Destination Weddings
- Engagement
- Luxury Events

Animation requirements:
- Smooth animated active indicator.
- Elegant hover transitions.
- Smooth filtering without sudden layout jumps.
- Animate newly filtered projects using staggered reveals.
- Maintain the selected category when navigating through the page.

Use only categories supported by actual project data.

## 3. PREMIUM PROJECT GALLERY
Create a sophisticated editorial portfolio layout.

Design:
- Asymmetrical masonry grid.
- Large cinematic featured project images.
- Mixed portrait and landscape compositions.
- Variable image sizes.
- Premium spacing and alignment.
- Avoid ordinary repetitive grid layouts.

Animation:
- Images reveal using cinematic clipping masks.
- Cards enter from different directions.
- Smooth right-to-left movement.
- Staggered image entrances.
- Subtle 3D perspective and depth.
- Scroll-based parallax movement.
- Smooth scale transitions.
- Cinematic motion blur where appropriate.

## 4. ADVANCED 3D HOVER INTERACTIONS
When hovering over a project:
- Apply subtle 3D tilt based on cursor position.
- Smoothly zoom the project image.
- Add elegant dark gradient overlays.
- Reveal project title and category.
- Animate the View Project arrow.
- Apply sophisticated lighting and shadow transitions.
- Restore the original state smoothly when the cursor leaves.

## 5. FEATURED PROJECT STORYTELLING
Create a premium featured-project experience.

When a project is selected:
- Open a dedicated project details page or existing project route.
- Display a large cinematic cover image.
- Show project title and event details.
- Create an immersive photography gallery.
- Support full-screen image viewing.
- Add smooth image transitions.
- Include next and previous project navigation.
- Provide a clear return-to-projects interaction.

Use genuine project information and existing routes.

## 6. HORIZONTAL CINEMATIC GALLERY
Add a premium horizontal portfolio showcase where appropriate.

- Cards move from right to left.
- Use scroll-linked animation.
- Add layered parallax and 3D depth.
- Create smooth transitions between featured projects.
- Use subtle scale and rotation.
- Ensure scrolling backward reverses the movement naturally.

Do not force horizontal scrolling across the entire page.

## 7. PROJECT DETAILS & INFORMATION
Display relevant project information elegantly:
- Project Name
- Wedding / Event Type
- Location
- Photography or Film Category
- Project Description
- Project Gallery

Only display fields that exist in the project data.

## 8. LOAD MORE / PAGINATION
- Implement elegant Load More functionality or pagination.
- Reveal additional projects using staggered cinematic animations.
- Avoid loading every large image immediately.
- Preserve category filters during pagination.
- Maintain smooth scrolling after loading new projects.

## 9. FINAL CINEMATIC CTA
Create a premium closing section:

"YOUR STORY DESERVES TO BE A MASTERPIECE"

Subtitle:
"Let's create something unforgettable together."

- Cinematic background image or video.
- Dramatic typography reveal.
- Slow background zoom.
- Elegant animated Contact Us button.
- Seamless transition into the footer.

## 10. ADVANCED ANIMATION TECHNOLOGY

Use:
- GSAP
- ScrollTrigger
- SplitType or equivalent text-splitting solution
- CSS 3D transforms
- Image masking and clipping
- Parallax scrolling
- Scroll-linked timelines

Every section should have a unique animation identity. Avoid repeating identical effects everywhere.

## 11. PERFORMANCE & RESPONSIVENESS
- Fully responsive desktop, tablet, and mobile.
- Optimized image formats such as WebP or AVIF.
- Lazy loading for gallery images.
- Use GPU-friendly transforms.
- Prevent flickering and layout shifts.
- Target smooth 60 FPS where hardware permits.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Maintain accessibility and SEO-friendly project content.

## 12. DEVELOPMENT INSTRUCTIONS
Before coding:
1. Analyze the existing Our Projects page.
2. Inspect project database, models, APIs, and image storage.
3. Understand existing project categories and routes.
4. Reuse existing project images and videos.
5. Preserve existing project data and functionality.
6. Implement the design directly into the existing project.
7. Test category filters, project details, navigation, and animations.
8. Verify desktop and mobile performance.

IMPORTANT:
- Do not create fake projects.
- Do not invent project statistics.
- Do not replace genuine images with random stock photos.
- Do not break existing routes or backend functionality.
- Do not create a separate demo page.

## FINAL EXPECTATION

Create an award-winning luxury wedding photography portfolio experience.

The Our Projects page should feel like a cinematic film gallery with:
- Immersive project presentations.
- Premium editorial masonry layouts.
- Cinematic image reveals.
- Sophisticated 3D hover effects.
- Smooth horizontal project movement.
- Interactive category filtering.
- Beautiful project detail experiences.
- Elegant cinematic transitions.

The final result must be original, premium, artistic, responsive, and production-ready.